    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried that, but it just makes me feel more disconnected. like, there is this idea i keep coming back to while i'm staring at the dark... that maybe the only way to truly make something \"real\" or \"pure\" is to actually consume yourself in the process. like the art shouldn't just be about the pain, it should be the pain itself. does that sound too much like i'm just spiraling?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
